  "statement": {
    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "Let Aut Fn be the automorphism group of a free group of rank n with norm\n|| · || as in 14.23. Does there exist a recursive function f : N × N → N with the\nfollowing property: for any two conjugate elements α, β ∈ Aut Fn there is an element\nγ ∈ Aut Fn such that γ −1 αγ = β and ||γ|| ⩽ f (||α||, ||β||)?      O. V. Bogopolski",
